title: "@three-ws/sign-language"
abstract: "American Sign Language for 3D avatars. Compile text into one continuous signed animation clip: known words sign from a lexicon of anatomically described signs, everything else fingerspells, with contact solving and non-manual facial markers. Zero runtime dependencies."
type: software
authors:
